# City life driven by the game without the world renderer (src/life/): the Roman Forum on an
# ordinary April morning, a minute of its life, then the Athenian Agora on the same morning;
# nobody is drawn walking on the spot. Then a bridge and a stair in each city: people on the
# deck and the treads, not through them, rising smoothly; boats under the bridges afloat.
set season spring
set day 9
set time 0.1667
set city forum
expect city live 450 900
expect city ground ok
expect city slots ok
expect city moving
expect city district forum 60 130
wait 900
expect city ground ok
expect city slots ok
expect city moving
expect city live 450 900
set season summer
set city agora
expect city live 300 900
expect city district agora 40 130
expect city ground ok
wait 600
expect city moving
set city_dump city_agora.json
set season spring
set city 121,1127
wait 300
expect city floor 3
expect city moving
set city district:rome/capitol
wait 300
expect city floor 3
set season summer
set city 307,632
wait 300
expect city floor 3
set city 306,575
wait 300
expect city floor 1
set season spring
set city 348,90
wait 300
expect city floor 3
expect city moving
set city 357,66
wait 300
expect city floor 1
set city off
quit
